{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan", "label": "SURGE-JV-006 KMZ Asset Classification Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_jv_006", "label": "SURGE-JV-006 Ticket", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three compounding defects made every KMZ placemark a WTG: the converter discarded folder names and never emitted assetType, the importer used a binary substation test with an else-to-WTG fallback, and the schema had nowhere to put a tower."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "label": "AssetClassifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordered first-match chain: explicit property, then KML folder evaluated one path segment at a time from the leaf upward, then ID pattern, then UNKNOWN - never WTG. Survey is tested before substation so Anantapur PSS_Borehole resolves as survey."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classification_rules", "label": "AssetClassificationRules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_kmz_geojson_converter", "label": "KmzGeoJsonConverter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The flat Placemark scan is replaced by a depth-first walk keeping folder names on a stack, emitting kmlFolder and kmlFolderPath joined with ' / ' so a bare slash in 220/11KV is not read as a separator; placemarks are deduped on normalised name plus 7-decimal coordinates."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_type", "label": "AssetType Domain Enum", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_wtg_status", "label": "WtgStatus and isOptimisable()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turbine status lives only in the folder name in the reference file; APPROVED, REGISTRATION and PROPOSED feed the optimiser while CANCELLED, LOW_AEP, TO_BE_SHIFTED and UNKNOWN do not, so only 38 of 99 turbine locations are eligible."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_evacuation_towers_table", "label": "evacuation_towers Table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A dedicated table was chosen because towers have no capacity_mw; wtg_locations' NOT NULL capacity is exactly why they could not be shoehorned in. wtg_locations.status is backfilled APPROVED so existing projects keep working, then defaults to UNKNOWN so new imports must be classified explicitly."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_preview_then_commit", "label": "Preview-Then-Commit Import Flow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Preview classifies and stages without persisting anything and returns the matched rule and evidence per feature; staged imports are held 30 minutes keyed by importId and pinned to the project so a handle cannot be replayed elsewhere."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_never_default_to_wtg", "label": "Unclassifiable Features Never Default to WTG", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The else-to-WTG fallback gave towers a fabricated 3.0 MW capacity that inflated feeder_count in group_wtgs and corrupted build_feeder_mst, so the optimiser output was silently wrong rather than visibly wrong; unmatched features now resolve to UNKNOWN and surface for a human decision."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_optimiser_isolation", "label": "Optimiser Isolation of Non-Optimisable Assets", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "OptimizationJobService filters on status.isOptimisable() before building the Python payload and fails with a distinct message when no turbine is eligible; towers are structurally excluded because they no longer live in the table that service reads."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_shared_browser_backend_rules", "label": "Shared Classification Rules in Browser and Backend", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/classify.js re-implements the same ordered rule chain in the browser so drag-and-drop rendering and server persistence cannot disagree; verification asserts browser rules agree with backend rules exactly."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_jv_006", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_jv_006", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1 Classification core", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classification_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_type", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_wtg_status", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1 status derivation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_kmz_geojson_converter", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "kmlFolder / kmlFolderPath feed the folder pass", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_never_default_to_wtg", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_asset_classifier", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a71.2 and \u00a74.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_optimiser_isolation", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_wtg_status", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.5 Optimiser isolation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_jv_006", "target": "docs_artifacts_surge_jv_006_kmz_asset_classification_plan_evacuation_towers_table", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/artifacts/SURGE-JV-006 - KMZ Asset Classification Plan.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.